{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["Concerning <b>the ark</b> and <b>the bronze altar</b> it is written <b>its staves</b> (בדיו), and concerning <b>the table</b> and <b>the golden altar</b> it is written <b>for the houses, for the staves</b> (לבתים לבדים) — and similarly. <b>Its staves</b>: to include the houses:"], :book "numbers", :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :es, :chapter 4, :timestamp "2026-07-27T13:10:58.551694695Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}